<title>HONG KONG: Robert Fleming sets Hutchison warrants.</title>
<headline>Robert Fleming sets Hutchison warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert Fleming &amp; Co Ltd said on Tuesday it intended to issue 65 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$44.20     PREMIUM	 10.08 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.985     GEARING	 5.0X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  16.JAN.98    PAYDATE	 01.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$49.10</p>
<p> NOTES		 GOVERNING LAW IS HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
